p for adoptation."},{"key":"B","text":"raised by his grandmother."}]},{"n":6,"stem":"Until the age of 37, John believed that his …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"mother was his older sister."},{"key":"B","text":"grandmother was his mother."}]},{"n":7,"stem":"John Joseph Furcillo is the …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"original name of the film star we now know as Jack Nicholson."},{"key":"B","text":"hero of a new film starring Jack Nicholson."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_05nov_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":631.32,"clip":"hang/e_angol_05nov_fl_H1.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
