he lifeboat, and getting the two yachtsmen safely to dry land.”"},{"key":"B","text":"When the lifeboat reached the scene, the captain realised he could not get his lifeboat close enough to the scene and launched the lifeboat’s inflatable vessel which filled with water and trapped the two lifeboat men along with the yachtsman on the reef. However, the Royal Navy Sea King helicopter was en route to the scene."},{"key":"C","text":"The two-man lifeboat crew became trapped on a sliver of reef along with a stranded yachtsman they had been attempting to rescue."},{"key":"D","text":"The hospital spokesman said: “They were feeling fine and have been discharged.”"},{"key":"E","text":"Once on land, he used his mobile phone to summon the rescue services."},{"key":"F","text":"It was a good operation; we got the other guy, too. Thankfully, all is well that ends well.”"},{"key":"G","text":"The pilot, Captain Ian Hills, then gingerly moved his Sea King helicopter toward a tiny island off the coast of Jura, in the Inner Hebrides, where he was able to pick up a second stranded yachtsman."}],"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"answer":"C"},{"n":24,"answer":"G"},{"n":25,"answer":"A"},{"n":26,"answer":"E"},{"n":27,"answer":"B"},{"n":28,"answer":"F"}]}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
insert into public.tasks (id, exam_id, section, number, kind, exam_type, points, position, content, audio) values ($mtr$2007-okt-emelt-L1$mtr$, $mtr$2007-okt-emelt$mtr$, $mtr$language$mtr$, 1, $mtr$choice$mtr$, $mtr$feleletválasztós szövegkiegészítés (A-D)$mtr$, 10, 5, $mtr${"id":"2007-okt-emelt-L1","number":1,"kind":"choice","layout":"inline","examType":"feleletválasztós szövegkiegészítés (A-D)","points":10,"instructions":["You are going to read an article about hamburgers. Some words are missing from the text.","Choose the most appropriate answer from the options (A-D) for each gap (1-10) in the text."],"title":"BURGER SERVED WITH LEGAL WARNING","body":["Diners wanting to taste a restaurant's £12 gourmet burgers last week {{0}} they had to sign a disclaimer. The document stated that the restaurant was not responsible for the consequences.","Managers at the Marriott West India Quay in east London's Docklands asked customers to complete the form {{1}} rare or medium-rare meat. The chef on duty also had to sign the paper, {{2}} said the restaurant should not be held responsible for food-poisoning. Customers {{3}} have their burgers cooked \"medium or above\" instead to reduce the risk.","A spokesman for Marriott said they stopped {{4}} the forms on Monday but warned customers they had the rare or medium-rare burgers \"at their own risk\". She added: \"We should {{5}} that we have full confidence in the meat products that we serve. {{6}}, customers who choose to have their burgers cooked rare or medium rare {{7}} at their own risk.\"","Nick Scade, chairman of the Restaurant Association, said: \"I {{8}} heard of anything like this before - and it's not something {{9}} in my restaurant. You've got to have a bit of common sense somewhere in life and if a customer wants to order raw meat they have to {{10}} responsibility for the risk they are taking.\""],"items":[{"n":0,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"refused"},{"key":"B","text":"will accept"},{"key":"C","text":"were told"},{"key":"D","text":"were asked"}],"example":true,"answer":"C"},{"n":1,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"unless they wanted"},{"key":"B","text":"if they asked"},{"key":"C","text":"so they ordered"},{"key":"D","text":"if they wanted"}]},{"n":2,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"which"},{"key":"B","text":"what"},{"key":"C","text":"Ø"},{"key":"D","text":"who"}]},{"n":3,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"allowed the chef"},{"key":"B","text":"happened to"},{"key":"C","text":"were urged to"},{"key":"D","text":"were used to"}]},{"n":4,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"to use"},{"key":"B","text":"having used"},{"key":"C","text":"using"},{"key":"D","text":"being used"}]},{"n":5,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"realise"},{"key":"B","text":"call attention"},{"key":"C","text":"care about"},{"key":"D","text":"point out"}]},{"n":6,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"Moreover"},{"key":"B","text":"Although"},{"key":"C","text":"However"},{"key":"D","text":"Otherwise"}]},{"n":7,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"do so"},{"key":"B","text":"eat that"},{"key":"C","text":"will do"},{"key":"D","text":"order it"}]},{"n":8,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"could have"},{"key":"B","text":"certainly haven’t"},{"key":"C","text":"probably haven’t"},{"key":"D","text":"might have"}]},{"n":9,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"I have been done"},{"key":"B","text":"I’ll include"},{"key":"C","text":"I’ll be doing"},{"key":"D","text":"I encourage it"}]},{"n":10,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"take any"},{"key":"B","text":"accept altogether"},{"key":"C","text":"take up"},{"key":"D","text":"accept some"}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, null)
