Unfortunately, Derosiers' X-ray vision didn't always work properly.","answer":"B"}],"options":[{"key":"A","text":"TRUE"},{"key":"B","text":"FALSE"},{"key":"C","text":"THE TEXT DOES NOT SAY"}]}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
insert into public.tasks (id, exam_id, section, number, kind, exam_type, points, position, content, audio) values ($mtr$2008-maj-emelt-H2$mtr$, $mtr$2008-maj-emelt$mtr$, $mtr$listening$mtr$, 2, $mtr$choice$mtr$, $mtr$feleletválasztás hallás után$mtr$, 8, 10, $mtr${"id":"2008-maj-emelt-H2","number":2,"kind":"choice","layout":"stems","examType":"feleletválasztás hallás után","points":8,"instructions":["In this section you are going to hear a lecture about language and communication.","Your task will be to write the letter of the correct answer into the boxes on the right.","First, you will have some time to study the task, and then we will play the whole recording in one piece.","Then, after a short pause, you will hear the recording again, but this time we will play the text in shorter sections to give you enough time to write down your answers.","At the end, you will have some more time to check your work."],"audio":{"file":"e_angol_08maj_fl.mp3","start":635.64,"end":1253.85,"clip":"hang/e_angol_08maj_fl_H2.mp3"},"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"stem":"The original Latin meaning of the word 'communicate' is to …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"give or share."},{"key":"B","text":"give information."},{"key":"C","text":"share ideas."}],"answer":"A"},{"n":12,"stem":"We don't know whether the children who lived with animals were able to …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"speak a human language."},{"key":"B","text":"communicate with the animals."},{"key":"C","text":"communicate with the people who found them."}]},{"n":13,"stem":"The two Indian girls found in the wilds were probably looked after by …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"some animals."},{"key":"B","text":"some unknown people."},{"key":"C","text":"nobody in particular."}]},{"n":14,"stem":"Those who 'brought up' Genie …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"spoke a language he couldn't understand."},{"key":"B","text":"never let him speak."},{"key":"C","text":"never talked to him."}]},{"n":15,"stem":"The boy found in the Central African forest …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"lived all alone."},{"key":"B","text":"could communicate with monkeys."},{"key":"C","text":"moved like a monkey."}]},{"n":16,"stem":"Even if we can speak a language very well, we can never be sure …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"how well our partner speaks the language."},{"key":"B","text":"that other people can understand our local accent."},{"key":"C","text":"that other people can understand our message."}]},{"n":17,"stem":"The role of common experiences is very clear in the case of representatives of different …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"professions."},{"key":"B","text":"cultures."},{"key":"C","text":"languages."}]},{"n":18,"stem":"Communication problems may occur in the case of …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"people who share the same interests."},{"key":"B","text":"languages with a very limited vocabulary."},{"key":"C","text":"peoples who live under different geographical conditions."}]},{"n":19,"stem":"If we want to communicate successfully, we must …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"have a vocabulary of more than 60 thousand words."},{"key":"B","text":"use the same words."},{"key":"C","text":"share similar experiences."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_08maj_fl.mp3","start":635.64,"end":1253.85,"clip":"hang/e_angol_08maj_fl_H2.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
