 out and found that you are a"},{"n":39,"text":"multimillionaire. What puzzles to us is why you would bother to"},{"n":40,"text":"borrow $5,000.\" The businessman replies him, \"Where else in San"}],"outro":"Francisco can I park my car for two weeks for $15? \""}$mtr$::jsonb, null)
