 to","answer":"as"},{"n":41,"text":"spare. The mapping agency was persuaded. New versions of the","answer":null},{"n":42,"text":"agency’s maps, which will appear in the next few months later, will","answer":"later"}],"outro":"reflect Mynydd Graig Goch's newly elevated status."}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
insert into public.tasks (id, exam_id, section, number, kind, exam_type, points, position, content, audio) values ($mtr$2009-maj-emelt-H1$mtr$, $mtr$2009-maj-emelt$mtr$, $mtr$listening$mtr$, 1, $mtr$multi$mtr$, $mtr$kettős választás (A, B vagy mindkettő)$mtr$, 7, 9, $mtr${"id":"2009-maj-emelt-H1","number":1,"kind":"multi","layout":"stems","examType":"kettős választás (A, B vagy mindkettő)","points":7,"instructions":["In this section you are going to hear a radio interview with John Pasche, a British artist.","Your task will be to circle the letter or letters of the correct answer or answers in the boxes on the right. Please note that in this task both answers may be correct. This means you will have to circle either A or B, or both A and B.","First, you will have some time to look at the task, and then we will play the whole recording in one piece.","Then, after a short pause, you will hear the recording again, but this time we will play the text in shorter sections to give you enough time to write down your answers."],"audio":{"file":"e_angol_09maj_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":699.2,"clip":"hang/e_angol_09maj_fl_H1.mp3"},"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"stem":"John Pasche designed a logo ...","options":[{"key":"A","text":"for the Rolling Stones."},{"key":"B","text":"in 1970."}],"answer":["A","B"]},{"n":1,"stem":"Mick Jagger was …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"looking for visual images for his band."},{"key":"B","text":"an art student in London."}]},{"n":2,"stem":"John Pasche …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"met Mick Jagger at his degree show."},{"key":"B","text":"designed a poster for the band."}]},{"n":3,"stem":"Mick Jagger …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"invited John to go on the band's European tour."},{"key":"B","text":"wanted to talk to John about a logo."}]},{"n":4,"stem":"The logo was inspired by …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"the band's feelings about British society."},{"key":"B","text":"Mick Jagger's lips and mouth."}]},{"n":5,"stem":"John …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"designed the logo in a fortnight."},{"key":"B","text":"was paid £200 for the logo in 1970."}]},{"n":6,"stem":"John has sold the logo …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"to a museum in London."},{"key":"B","text":"for more than £50,000."}]},{"n":7,"stem":"John needs the money to cover the expenses of his …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"son's education."},{"key":"B","text":"holidays abroad."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_09maj_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":699.2,"clip":"hang/e_angol_09maj_fl_H1.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
