The service allows subscribers to ... their favourite sports stars.","options":[{"key":"A","text":"receive messages from"},{"key":"B","text":"send messages to"}]},{"n":26,"stem":"The director of \"Text a Star\" says Hewitt ...","options":[{"key":"A","text":"does not get any money for working for the service."},{"key":"B","text":"is mainly interested in supplying his fans with first-hand information."}]},{"n":27,"stem":"The magazine … carried articles on one of the Hewitt babies.","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Woman’s Day"},{"key":"B","text":"OK!"}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_13maj_fl.mp3","start":1211.05,"end":1795.52,"clip":"hang/e_angol_13maj_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
