ay"],["desserts"]]},{"n":24,"stem":"It was only in {{gap}} that Father’s Day was officially made a(n) {{gap}} event.","gaps":[["1924"],["national"]]},{"n":25,"stem":"When children can’t visit their fathers on that day, they usually send them a greeting card which is traditionally not {{gap}} but {{gap}}.","gaps":[["sentimental"],["funny"]]}],"grading":{"spelling":"lenient","caseSensitive":false,"note":"(Csak akkor adható pont, ha mindkét szó elfogadható. Fél pont nincs!)"}}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
