nsecutive draws to become the country's"},{"n":41,"text":"biggest ever jackpot and more millions of people bought tickets."},{"n":42,"text":"The winner beat up odds of one in nearly 29 million."},{"n":43,"text":"When the man realised he had won, he was said: \" How sad for"},{"n":44,"text":"that woman. She could have won the big prize if she had just been"}],"outro":"patient. \" (www.bbc.co.uk)"}$mtr$::jsonb, null)
