and sister."},{"key":"B","text":"father can help her any time."},{"key":"C","text":"grandma sometimes takes care of the little ones."}]},{"n":23,"stem":"Ashleigh is quite ...","options":[{"key":"A","text":"sure her new show will be much better than her Britain’s Got Talent show."},{"key":"B","text":"worried because of the growing expectations."},{"key":"C","text":"glad that they didn’t use all their moves and routines in the talent show."}]},{"n":24,"stem":"Ashleigh ...","options":[{"key":"A","text":"has less than a month to prepare for the Royal Variety Performance."},{"key":"B","text":"still doesn’t know what kind of music she will choose."},{"key":"C","text":"thinks that harmonizing the music and the moves is easy."}]},{"n":25,"stem":"Pudsey ...","options":[{"key":"A","text":"finds the camera funny."},{"key":"B","text":"feels when the camera is on."},{"key":"C","text":"sniffs around the camera."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"k_angol_14maj_fl.mp3","start":1265.77,"end":1795.19,"clip":"hang/k_angol_14maj_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
