ll team."},{"key":"B","text":"stands in the stadium."}],"answer":["A"]},{"n":6,"stem":"Both Wembley Stadium and Wembley Arena host …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"concerts."},{"key":"B","text":"sporting events."}],"answer":["A","B"]},{"n":7,"stem":"After dark, the stadium …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"can be seen from a distance of 30 miles when it’s lit up."},{"key":"B","text":"has a warning light on its arch."}],"answer":["B"]}]}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
insert into public.tasks (id, exam_id, section, number, kind, exam_type, points, position, content, audio) values ($mtr$2014-okt-kozep-H2$mtr$, $mtr$2014-okt-kozep$mtr$, $mtr$listening$mtr$, 2, $mtr$text$mtr$, $mtr$mondatkiegészítés hallás után$mtr$, 6, 9, $mtr${"id":"2014-okt-kozep-H2","number":2,"kind":"text","layout":"stems","examType":"mondatkiegészítés hallás után","points":6,"instructions":["In this section, you will hear a story about a lucky lottery winner in New Zealand.","Your task will be to complete the sentences with the exact words you hear in the text. Write one word in each gap.","First, you will have some time to look at the task, and then we will play the whole recording in one piece.","Then, after a short pause, you will hear the recording again, but this time we will play the text in shorter sections to give you enough time to write down your answers."],"audio":{"file":"k_angol_14okt_fl.mp3","start":800.28,"end":1206.45,"clip":"hang/k_angol_14okt_fl_H2.mp3"},"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"stem":"The winner’s Lotto ticket survived a trip through the guy’s washing {{gap}}.","accept":["machine"]},{"n":8,"stem":"He had bought the ticket at a {{gap}} in the city."},{"n":9,"stem":"He shared the {{gap}} with three other winners."},{"n":10,"stem":"He found the ticket last {{gap}} after he washed his clothes."},{"n":11,"stem":"The ticket was in one of the pockets of his old {{gap}}."},{"n":12,"stem":"He went to the city center to buy his {{gap}}."},{"n":13,"stem":"Christchurch was devastated in a huge {{gap}} in February."}],"grading":{"spelling":"lenient"}}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"k_angol_14okt_fl.mp3","start":800.28,"end":1206.45,"clip":"hang/k_angol_14okt_fl_H2.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
