uch events every so often to attract few customers. Examples"},{"n":41,"text":"include in the ‘dark dining’ experience at Catharsis, which is"}],"outro":"in Miami, or Camaje Bistro in New York City’s Greenwich Village. (http://www.restaurants.com)"}$mtr$::jsonb, null)
