erview was made, the announcements could be heard on the …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"airport bus."},{"key":"B","text":"underground."}]},{"n":17,"stem":"When Rachel listened to the first recordings, she wasn’t really satisfied with the …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"wording of the announcements."},{"key":"B","text":"way she read out the text."}]},{"n":18,"stem":"In her everyday life, Rachel …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"doesn’t often use Hungarian."},{"key":"B","text":"is not happy with her Hungarian."}]},{"n":19,"stem":"Rachel …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"has been in Hungary for almost two decades."},{"key":"B","text":"considers herself an honorary Hungarian."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_15okt_fl.mp3","start":713.94,"end":1331.17,"clip":"hang/e_angol_15okt_fl_H2.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
