B","text":"now has a place all to himself in Barcelona."}]},{"n":22,"stem":"Sam’s Barcelona flat …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"is in rather poor condition."},{"key":"B","text":"costs him €800 a month."}]},{"n":23,"stem":"Sam says the move was really worth it, as …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"his lifestyle has improved a lot."},{"key":"B","text":"he can even save some money."}]},{"n":24,"stem":"The arrangement, however, is somewhat problematic, because …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"air-ticket prices keep changing."},{"key":"B","text":"the journey takes more than six hours."}]},{"n":25,"stem":"He uses the time he spends on the plane to …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"get some sleep."},{"key":"B","text":"enjoy a leisurely drink."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"k_angol_17okt_fl.mp3","start":1156.53,"end":1795.43,"clip":"hang/k_angol_17okt_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
