"text":"is in rather poor condition."},{"key":"B","text":"costs him €800 a month."}],"answer":["B"]},{"n":23,"stem":"Sam says the move was really worth it, as …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"his lifestyle has improved a lot."},{"key":"B","text":"he can even save some money."}],"answer":["A","B"]},{"n":24,"stem":"The arrangement, however, is somewhat problematic, because …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"air-ticket prices keep changing."},{"key":"B","text":"the journey takes more than six hours."}],"answer":["A"]},{"n":25,"stem":"He uses the time he spends on the plane to …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"get some sleep."},{"key":"B","text":"enjoy a leisurely drink."}],"answer":["A","B"]}]}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
