2},{"n":23,"stem":"On account of the enormous number of visitors every year, Venetians have long complained about {{gap}} {{gap}}.","gapCount":2},{"n":24,"stem":"People who are caught {{gap}} in the {{gap}} are faced with the heaviest fine of €450.","gapCount":2},{"n":25,"stem":"Last December, the city also decided to introduce a(n) {{gap}} {{gap}} of up to £10 for short-stay tourists.","gapCount":2}],"grading":{"spelling":"lenient"}}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_20maj_fl.mp3","start":1225.69,"end":1795.43,"clip":"hang/e_angol_20maj_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
