t theories about how it happened. \"God created Adam and Eve and they were Ubang people,\" says the chief. \"God's plan was to give each ethnic group two languages, but after creating the two languages for the Ubang, he realised that he simply didn’t have enough languages to hand out. So he stopped,\" he explains.","\"That's why Ubang has the benefit of two languages – we are different from other people in the world.\"","(bbc.co.uk)"],"options":[{"key":"A","text":"TRUE"},{"key":"B","text":"FALSE"},{"key":"C","text":"NOT ENOUGH INFORMATION"}],"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"stem":"There is a village where the language people speak depends on their sex.","answer":"A"},{"n":14,"stem":"The chief's daughter cannot immediately give the word for cup.","answer":"B"},{"n":15,"stem":"Most of the words are the same in the male and the female language.","answer":"C"},{"n":16,"stem":"There are more male than female words in Ubang.","answer":"C"},{"n":17,"stem":"The male words are more difficult to pronounce than the female words.","answer":"C"},{"n":18,"stem":"In Ubang, a man and a woman have no more problems understanding each other than, for example, a man and a woman in the UK.","answer":"A"},{"n":19,"stem":"Boys learn the male language from their fathers.","answer":"C"},{"n":20,"stem":"According to the chief, God gave two languages to every ethnic group in the world.","answer":"B"}]}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
insert into public.tasks (id, exam_id, section, number, kind, exam_type, points, position, content, audio) values ($mtr$2020-maj-kozep-R4$mtr$, $mtr$2020-maj-kozep$mtr$, $mtr$reading$mtr$, 4, $mtr$bank$mtr$, $mtr$mondatrész visszahelyezése szövegbe$mtr$, 7, 4, $mtr${"id":"2020-maj-kozep-R4","number":4,"kind":"bank","layout":"inline","examType":"mondatrész visszahelyezése szövegbe","points":7,"instructions":["In this article about flight incidents, some parts of sentences have been left out.","Your task is to reconstruct the text by filling in the gaps (21-27) from the list (A-K) below.","Remember that there are two extra parts of sentences that you will not need."],"title":"IN-FLIGHT INCIDENTS IN INDIA – MORE SERIOUS THAN FUNNY","body":["A passenger has recently been taken off a domestic flight in India {{0}} to charge his phone. The man, who was drunk, tried to enter the cockpit {{21}} for Kolkata from the western city of Mumbai. He was eventually removed from the aircraft and handed over to police because of a security violation. Police later questioned the man {{22}}.","The falling price of air tickets {{23}} have led to a boom in domestic flights. Carriers say that there are a lot of first-time flyers, which also presents new challenges. One airline, Air Asia India, said it was producing a how-to video for new customers {{24}}, from the need to show up on time to instructions on how to use an onboard toilet.","In another incident earlier this year, a Qatar Airways flight made an emergency landing in the southern city of Chennai, {{25}} to unlock his phone, where she discovered evidence he was cheating on her. She reportedly began attacking her husband {{26}}, the flight was forced to make an emergency stop.","The behaviour of the crew is not always perfect either. Jet Airways has suspended two pilots for five years after a male pilot slapped his female co-pilot during a flight to Mumbai. She reportedly stormed out of the cockpit {{27}}, leaving the plane on auto-pilot.","(guardian.co.uk)"],"bank":[{"key":"A","text":"and rising incomes in India"},{"key":"B","text":"after a woman used her sleeping husband’s thumb"},{"key":"C","text":"after trying to enter the cockpit"},{"key":"D","text":"but released him soon after"},{"key":"E","text":"informing them about the dangers of flying"},{"key":"F","text":"and the male pilot eventually left to find her"},{"key":"G","text":"explaining important aspects of air travel"},{"key":"H","text":"and the plane was flown to the nearest airport"},{"key":"I","text":"while the plane prepared to take off"},{"key":"K","text":"and as cabin crew were unable to handle the situation"}],"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"answer":"C"},{"n":21},{"n":22},{"n":23},{"n":24},{"n":25},{"n":26},{"n":27}]}$mtr$::jsonb, null)
