involves sunbathing and {{22}} in the sea.","The person who gets the job will have to write a(n) {{23}} about their adventures in Queensland.","The duration of the job is {{24}} months.","The island caretaker has to have a level of {{25}} good enough to communicate with locals.","The caretaker will have to share videos once a {{26}}.","The person who gets the job will stay in a house for {{27}}."],"grading":{"spelling":"lenient","caseSensitive":false},"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"accept":["island"]},{"n":22,"accept":["swimming","snorkelling","diving","snorkeling"]},{"n":23,"accept":["blog","diary"]},{"n":24,"accept":["6","six"]},{"n":25,"accept":["English","communication"]},{"n":26,"accept":["week"]},{"n":27,"accept":["free","nothing"]}]}$mtr$::jsonb) on conflict (task_id) do update set task = excluded.task;
insert into public.tasks (id, exam_id, section, number, kind, exam_type, points, position, content, audio) values ($mtr$2020-okt-kozep-L1$mtr$, $mtr$2020-okt-kozep$mtr$, $mtr$language$mtr$, 1, $mtr$text$mtr$, $mtr$szóképzés (zárójeles szó)$mtr$, 8, 5, $mtr${"id":"2020-okt-kozep-L1","number":1,"kind":"text","layout":"inline","examType":"szóképzés (zárójeles szó)","points":8,"instructions":["You are going to read a joke about a father explaining words to his daughter. Some words are missing from the text.","Use the words in brackets to form the words that fit in the gaps (1-8).","There might be cases when you do not have to change the word in brackets.","Use only one word for each gap."],"title":"ANGRY OR FURIOUS?","body":["A young girl was preparing for her {{0}} exam. One day she came home {{1}} and asked her father, “Dad, what is the {{2}} between anger and fury?\"","The father replied, “The second is much stronger than the {{3}}. Let me show you …”","The father went to the telephone and dialled a number at random. To the man who answered the phone, he said, “Hello, is Melvin there?”","A rather {{4}} male voice answered, “There is no Melvin here. Check that number again!”","“See,” said the father to his daughter. “That man was not really happy with our call. He was probably busy, and found our call a bit {{5}}. Now watch ...”","The father dialled the same number again. “Hello, is Melvin there?” asked the father. “Now look here!” came the heated {{6}}. “I’ve just told you that there is no Melvin here! Leave me alone!” The receiver was slammed down {{7}}.","The father turned to his daughter and said, “You see, that was anger. Now I’ll show you what fury means.”","He dialled the same number, and a violent voice shouted, “HELLO!” The father {{8}} said, “Hello, this is Melvin. Have there been any calls for me?”","(http://jokestop.net)"],"grading":{"spelling":"strict"},"items":[{"n":0,"prompt":"finish","example":true,"accept":["final"]},{"n":1,"prompt":"exhaust"},{"n":2,