 technology. Petpuls Lab has started"}],"outro":"marketing the collar online in October last year at $99.","source":"https://www.reuters.com/article/us-southkorea-dog-smartcollar/south-korean-firms-smart-dog-collar-tells-owners-whats-in-a-"}$mtr$::jsonb, null)
