ing."}]},{"n":5,"stem":"Daniella and John were … when the ring disappeared.","options":[{"key":"A","text":"eating in a restaurant"},{"key":"B","text":"standing in Times Square"},{"key":"C","text":"heading for their hotel"}]},{"n":6,"stem":"Daniella and John …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"lifted the grate with a crow bar to find the ring."},{"key":"B","text":"decided to have a nice weekend anyway."},{"key":"C","text":"made sure the police recorded their names."}]},{"n":7,"stem":"After Daniella and John arrived back home, they …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"went to a jewellery store to buy another ring."},{"key":"B","text":"were told about the social media campaign."},{"key":"C","text":"were phoned by the New York Police Deparment."}]},{"n":8,"stem":"The CCTV footage showed … searching for the ring.","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Daniella and John"},{"key":"B","text":"helpful New Yorkers"},{"key":"C","text":"Special Operations Officers"}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_21maj_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":583.24,"clip":"hang/e_angol_21maj_fl_H1.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
