According to the museum guide, Goya’s painting is as powerful now as it was in the past."}],"options":[{"key":"A","text":"TRUE"},{"key":"B","text":"FALSE"},{"key":"C","text":"THE TEXT DOES NOT SAY"}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_21maj_fl.mp3","start":583.24,"end":1233.56,"clip":"hang/e_angol_21maj_fl_H2.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
insert into public.task_keys (task_id, task) values ($mtr$2021-maj-emelt-H2$mtr$, $mtr${"id":"2021-maj-emelt-H2","number":2,"kind":"choice","layout":"stems","examType":"igaz / hamis / a szöveg nem mondja (A/B/C)","points":9,"instructions":["In this section you will hear a museum guide describing a famous painting by Francisco Goya.","Your task will be to decide whether the following statements are true, false or we do not know because the text does not say, and write the appropriate letter in the boxes on the right. Write A if the statement is true, write B if the statement is false, and write C if the text does not say.","First, you will have some time to look at the task, and then we will play the recording twice.","Then, after a short pause, you will hear the recording again, but this time we will play the text in shorter sections to give you enough time to make your decision about the answers."],"audio":{"file":"e_angol_21maj_fl.mp3","start":583.24,"end":1233.56,"clip":"hang/e_angol_21maj_fl_H2.mp3"},"items":[{"n":0,"example":true,"stem":"The museum guide says that the Francisco Goya room is the first stop on the tour.","answer":"B"},{"n":9,"stem":"Goya finished the painting in the second decade of the 19th century.","answer":"A"},{"n":10,"stem":"Napoleon’s brother became the king of Spain.","answer":"A"},{"n":11,"stem":"The French executed hundreds of Spanish people on the 3rd of May.","answer":"C"},{"n":12,"stem":"Goya had never sympathized with the French Revolution.","answer":"B"},{"n":13,"stem":"No painter had used light and dark before as powerfully as Goya did.","answer":"C"},{"n":14,"stem":"The man in the white shirt was a well-known aristocrat.","answer":"B"},{"n":15,"stem":"The light from the moon fell on the soldiers.","answer":"B"},{"n":16,"stem":"Goya’s portrayal of the French soldiers shows that they felt no pity for their victims.","answer":"A"},{"n":17,"stem":"According to the museum guide, Goya’s painting is as powerful now as it was in the past