through the alley must kiss on that"},{"n":33,"text":"step – where Carlos’ spirit is thought to be watching over with"},{"n":34,"text":"lovers – if they want their romance to endure. If they don’t kiss,"},{"n":35,"text":"they’ll be cursed with seven more years of bad luck. If they kiss,"}],"outro":"they’ll receive 15 years of good luck.","source":"http://www.bbc.com/travel/story/20160204-where-one-kiss-brings-15-years-of-luck"}$mtr$::jsonb, null)
