"Who did Gustáv Popovič send a postcard with Lunch Atop a Skyscraper to? To {{gap}}."}],"grading":{"spelling":"keywords"}}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"e_angol_23okt_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":605.03,"clip":"hang/e_angol_23okt_fl_H1.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
