."},{"key":"B","text":"stopped warning passengers of the gap."}]},{"n":6,"stem":"Margaret asked London Underground to …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"continue playing Oswald Laurence’s ‘Mind the Gap’ announcement."},{"key":"B","text":"give her a copy of Oswald Laurence’s recording."}]},{"n":7,"stem":"The original ‘Mind the Gap’ announcement by Oswald Laurence …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"can only be heard at the Embankment stop of the Northern Line."},{"key":"B","text":"is played three times every time a train enters the Embankment station."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"k_angol_24maj_fl.mp3","start":0,"end":721.1,"clip":"hang/k_angol_24maj_fl_H1.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
