nd two sons."}]},{"n":22,"stem":"Harry Kane cried when …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Portugal beat England."},{"key":"B","text":"his first child was born."}]},{"n":23,"stem":"The perfect Sunday for Harry Kane …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"starts with golf in the morning."},{"key":"B","text":"ends with a cup of tea."}]},{"n":24,"stem":"Harry Kane …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"disagrees that pizza or chips are unhealthy."},{"key":"B","text":"sometimes eats pizza or chips."}]},{"n":25,"stem":"Harry Kane …","options":[{"key":"A","text":"wanted some tattoos when he was younger."},{"key":"B","text":"followed his father’s advice."}]}]}$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr${"file":"k_angol_25okt_fl.mp3","start":1111.85,"end":1799,"clip":"hang/k_angol_25okt_fl_H3.mp3"}$mtr$::jsonb)
