 aim","hu":"célirányos, összpontosított"},{"forms":["managing director"],"lemma":"managing director","pos":"noun","en":"the person who runs a company","hu":"ügyvezető igazgató"},{"forms":["investment banking"],"lemma":"investment banking","pos":"noun","en":"the part of banking that deals with large companies and investments","hu":"befektetési banki tevékenység"},{"forms":["arm"],"lemma":"arm","pos":"noun","en":"one part of a big organisation","hu":"ág, részleg"},{"forms":["opportunity"],"lemma":"opportunity","pos":"noun","en":"a chance to do something","hu":"lehetőség, alkalom"},{"forms":["make more than a financial difference"],"lemma":"make a difference","pos":"phrase","en":"to help in a way that is more than just giving money","hu":"nemcsak pénzzel segíteni, hanem másképp is"},{"forms":["varied"],"lemma":"varied","pos":"adjective","en":"of many different kinds","hu":"változatos, sokféle"},{"forms":["acquired brain injuries"],"lemma":"acquired brain injury","pos":"noun","en":"damage to the brain that happens after birth, e.g. in an accident","hu":"szerzett agysérülés"},{"forms":["readjust"],"lemma":"readjust","pos":"verb","en":"to get used to a situation again","hu":"újra beilleszkedik, visszaszokik"},{"forms":["autism"],"lemma":"autism","pos":"noun","en":"a condition that makes communication with other people difficult","hu":"autizmus"},{"forms":["refugees"],"lemma":"refugee","pos":"noun","en":"a person who had to leave their country because of war or danger","hu":"menekült"},{"forms":["asylum seekers"],"lemma":"asylum seeker","pos":"noun","en":"a person who asks to stay in another country because they are in danger at home","hu":"menedékkérő"},{"forms":["migrants"],"lemma":"migrant","pos":"noun","en":"a person who moves to another country to find work","hu":"bevándorló, migráns"},{"forms":["assist"],"lemma":"assist","pos":"verb","en":"to help","hu":"segít"},{"forms":["thorough assessment"],"lemma":"thorough assessment","pos":"noun","en":"a careful and complete e