","pos":"preposition","en":"different from","hu":"valamivel ellentétben"},{"forms":["empower"],"lemma":"empower","pos":"verb","en":"to give someone the power to decide things","hu":"felhatalmaz, döntési jogot ad"},{"forms":["shop-floor workers"],"lemma":"shop-floor worker","pos":"noun","en":"a worker who makes things in a factory, not a manager","hu":"fizikai dolgozó, munkás"}]$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr$[]$mtr$::jsonb)
