efully in different directions","hu":"manőverez, irányít"},{"forms":["vertically"],"lemma":"vertically","pos":"adverb","en":"up and down","hu":"függőlegesen"},{"forms":["laterally"],"lemma":"laterally","pos":"adverb","en":"to the side; from side to side","hu":"oldalirányban"},{"forms":["threatened"],"lemma":"threatened","pos":"adjective","en":"in danger of being attacked or harmed","hu":"veszélyeztetett, fenyegetett"},{"forms":["secure"],"lemma":"secure","pos":"adjective","en":"safe and protected","hu":"biztonságos, védett"},{"forms":["touch down"],"lemma":"touch down","pos":"phrasal verb","en":"to land","hu":"leszáll, földet ér"},{"forms":["existing"],"lemma":"existing","pos":"adjective","en":"already there and in use","hu":"már meglévő, létező"},{"forms":["landing aids"],"lemma":"landing aid","pos":"noun","en":"equipment that helps a plane to land safely","hu":"leszállást segítő berendezés"},{"forms":["built-in"],"lemma":"built-in","pos":"adjective","en":"forming part of something, not separate","hu":"beépített"},{"forms":["bring the plane safely to a halt"],"lemma":"bring something to a halt","pos":"phrase","en":"to make something stop moving","hu":"biztonságosan megállítja a gépet"},{"forms":["runway"],"lemma":"runway","pos":"noun","en":"the long road at an airport where planes take off and land","hu":"kifutópálya"},{"forms":["insiders"],"lemma":"insider","pos":"noun","en":"a person who works in an organization and knows secret things about it","hu":"bennfentes"},{"forms":["kit"],"lemma":"kit","pos":"noun","en":"a set of equipment","hu":"felszerelés, berendezés"},{"forms":["fitted to"],"lemma":"fit to","pos":"phrase","en":"to put a piece of equipment onto something","hu":"felszerel, beszerel valamibe"},{"forms":["disclosure"],"lemma":"disclosure","pos":"noun","en":"making public something that was secret","hu":"nyilvánosságra hozatal, leleplezés"},{"forms":["passenger-monitoring device"],"lemma":"passenger-monitoring device","pos":"noun","en":"a machine that watches passengers all the time","hu":"utasfigyelő berendezés"},{"forms":["linked to"],"lemma":"link to","pos":"phrase","en":"to connect one thing to another","hu":"összekapcsol, csatlakoztat valamihez"},{"forms":["facial expression"],"lemma":"facial expression","pos":"noun","en":"the look on someone's face that shows how they feel","hu":"arckifejezés"},{"forms":["suspicious"],"lemma":"suspicious","pos":"adjective","en":"making you think that something is wrong or illegal","hu":"gyanús"},{"forms":["in order to"],"lemma":"in order to","pos":"phrase","en":"so that you can","hu":"azért, hogy; annak érdekében, hogy"},{"forms":["potential"],"lemma":"potential","pos":"adjective","en":"possible in the future","hu":"lehetséges, potenciális"},{"forms":["spokesman"],"lemma":"spokesman","pos":"noun","en":"a person who speaks officially for a company","hu":"szóvivő"},{"forms":["efficiency"],"lemma":"efficiency","pos":"noun","en":"working well without wasting time or money","hu":"hatékonyság"},{"forms":["fleet"],"lemma":"fleet","pos":"noun","en":"all the planes, ships or vehicles of a company or country","hu":"flotta, (repülő)gépállomány"},{"forms":["technique"],"lemma":"technique","pos":"noun","en":"a particular way of doing something","hu":"módszer, technika"},{"forms":["conclusively"],"lemma":"conclusively","pos":"adverb","en":"in a way that ends all doubt; completely","hu":"véglegesen, biztosan"},{"forms":["unauthorised persons"],"lemma":"unauthorised person","pos":"noun","en":"someone who does not have official permission","hu":"illetéktelen személy"},{"forms":["gaining access to"],"lemma":"gain access to","pos":"phrase","en":"to manage to get into a place or reach something","hu":"hozzáfér, bejut valahová"},{"forms":["initiated"],"lemma":"initiate","pos":"verb","en":"to start something","hu":"elindít, beindít"},{"forms":["violence"],"lemma":"violence","pos":"noun","en":"behaviour that is meant to hurt or kill people","hu":"erőszak"}]$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr$[]$mtr$::jsonb)
insert into public.task_glossary (task_id, entries, after_submit) values ($mtr$2010-okt-emelt-R4$mtr$, $mtr$[{"forms":["put up"],"lemma":"put up","pos":"phrasal verb","en":"to fix a sign or notice on a wall so people can see it","hu":"kitesz, kifüggeszt"},{"forms":["health chiefs"],"lemma":"health chief","pos":"noun","en":"a person in charge of health services","hu":"egészségügyi vezető"},{"forms":["banning"],"lemma":"ban","pos":"verb","en":"to say officially that something is not allowed","hu":"betilt, megtilt"},{"forms":["religious leaders"],"lemma":"religious leader","pos":"noun","en":"a person who leads a church or religion","hu":"egyházi vezető"},{"forms":["puzzled"],"lemma":"puzzled","pos":"adjective","en":"confused because you cannot understand something","hu":"értetlen, tanácstalan"},{"forms":["smoking ban"],"lemma":"smoking ban","pos":"noun","en":"a law that does not allow people to smoke in a place","hu":"dohányzási tilalom"},{"forms":["enclosed public places"],"lemma":"enclosed public place","pos":"noun","en":"a public building or room with walls and a roof","hu":"zárt középület, zárt nyilvános hely"},{"forms":["comes into effect"],"lemma":"come into effect","pos":"phrase","en":"to start to be used as a law","hu":"hatályba lép"},{"forms":["figures"],"lemma":"figure","pos":"noun","en":"an important person","hu":"személyiség, vezető személy"},{"forms":["assumed"],"lemma":"assume","pos":"verb","en":"to think something is true without checking","hu":"feltételez, magától értetődőnek vesz"},{"forms":["governs"],"lemma":"govern","pos":"verb","en":"to control and manage something","hu":"irányít, igazgat"},{"forms":["concerns"],"lemma":"concern","pos":"noun","en":"a worry","hu":"aggály, aggodalom"},{"forms":["clergyman"],"lemma":"clergyman","pos":"noun","en":"a priest in the Christian church","hu":"lelkész, pap"},{"forms":["identical"],"lemma":"identical","pos":"adjective","en":"exactly the same","hu":"azonos, egyforma"},{"forms":["information packs"],"lemma":"inf