n","en":"a flow of electricity","hu":"áram"},{"forms":["apparently"],"lemma":"apparently","pos":"adverb","en":"it seems that; from what people say","hu":"úgy tűnik, látszólag"},{"forms":["traveled"],"lemma":"travel","pos":"verb","en":"here: to move from one place to another (electricity)","hu":"terjedt, haladt","tip":"Amerikai írásmód; brit angolban travelled."},{"forms":["slick"],"lemma":"slick","pos":"noun","en":"a thin layer of liquid on a surface","hu":"réteg, vízfilm (a felszínen)"},{"forms":["surface"],"lemma":"surface","pos":"noun","en":"the top or outside part of something","hu":"felület, felszín"},{"forms":["chances"],"lemma":"chance","pos":"noun","en":"how likely it is that something will happen","hu":"esély, valószínűség"},{"forms":["lifetime"],"lemma":"lifetime","pos":"noun","en":"the time during which someone is alive","hu":"élet (egész élete során)"},{"forms":["grounded"],"lemma":"ground","pos":"verb","en":"to connect electrical equipment to the earth so that it is safe","hu":"földel"},{"forms":["otherwise"],"lemma":"otherwise","pos":"adverb","en":"apart from that","hu":"egyébként, ettől eltekintve"},{"forms":["bright"],"lemma":"bright","pos":"adjective","en":"giving out a lot of strong light","hu":"fényes, vakító"},{"forms":["earlier"],"lemma":"earlier","pos":"adverb","en":"before the time you are talking about","hu":"korábban"},{"forms":["roof"],"lemma":"roof","pos":"noun","en":"the structure that covers the top of a building","hu":"tető"},{"forms":["probably"],"lemma":"probably","pos":"adverb","en":"almost certainly","hu":"valószínűleg"},{"forms":["hurt"],"lemma":"hurt","pos":"verb","en":"to injure a part of your body","hu":"megsért, megüt (testrészt)","tip":"Rendhagyó ige: hurt – hurt – hurt."},{"forms":["his life was saved"],"lemma":"save someone's life","pos":"phrase","en":"to stop someone from dying","hu":"megmentette az életét"}]$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr$[{"forms":["struck by lightning"],"lemma":"be struck by lightning","pos":"phrase","en":"to be hit 