orry and fear","hu":"komoly aggodalom, nagy riadalom"},{"forms":["fortunately"],"lemma":"fortunately","pos":"adverb","en":"luckily","hu":"szerencsére"},{"forms":["managed to"],"lemma":"manage to","pos":"phrase","en":"to succeed in doing something difficult","hu":"sikerült neki"},{"forms":["inform"],"lemma":"inform","pos":"verb","en":"to tell someone about something","hu":"tájékoztat, értesít"},{"forms":["misadventure"],"lemma":"misadventure","pos":"noun","en":"a bad or unlucky experience","hu":"balszerencsés kaland, malőr"},{"forms":["just as"],"lemma":"just as","pos":"conjunction","en":"exactly at the time when","hu":"éppen akkor, amikor"},{"forms":["contemplating"],"lemma":"contemplate","pos":"verb","en":"to think seriously about doing something","hu":"fontolgat"},{"forms":["launching"],"lemma":"launch","pos":"verb","en":"to start a big organized activity","hu":"elindít"},{"forms":["mass manhunt"],"lemma":"mass manhunt","pos":"noun","en":"a big search by many people, usually the police, to find someone","hu":"nagyszabású hajtóvadászat, kiterjedt keresés"},{"forms":["made it home"],"lemma":"make it home","pos":"phrase","en":"to succeed in getting home","hu":"hazaért, sikerült hazajutnia"},{"forms":["embarking on"],"lemma":"embark on","pos":"phrasal verb","en":"to start a journey or something new","hu":"belevág valamibe, útnak indul"},{"forms":["inadvertent"],"lemma":"inadvertent","pos":"adjective","en":"not done on purpose","hu":"akaratlan, nem szándékos"},{"forms":["odyssey"],"lemma":"odyssey","pos":"noun","en":"a very long journey with many adventures","hu":"odüsszeia, kalandos hosszú út"}]$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr$[]$mtr$::jsonb)
