ll or hurt","hu":"hordágy"},{"forms":["steps"],"lemma":"step","pos":"noun","en":"one of a series of surfaces for walking up or down; stairs","hu":"lépcsőfok, lépcső"},{"forms":["paramedics"],"lemma":"paramedic","pos":"noun","en":"a person who helps ill or hurt people before they get to hospital","hu":"mentőápoló, mentős"},{"forms":["burned himself"],"lemma":"burn yourself","pos":"phrase","en":"to hurt yourself with fire or heat","hu":"megégette magát"},{"forms":["so hard"],"lemma":"so hard","pos":"phrase","en":"so much","hu":"annyira, olyan erősen"},{"forms":["tipped"],"lemma":"tip","pos":"verb","en":"to make something lean to one side so that it falls over","hu":"megbillent"},{"forms":["dropped"],"lemma":"drop","pos":"verb","en":"to let something fall","hu":"leejt"},{"forms":["remaining"],"lemma":"remaining","pos":"adjective","en":"still there; left","hu":"megmaradt, hátralévő"},{"forms":["ankle"],"lemma":"ankle","pos":"noun","en":"the joint between your foot and your leg","hu":"boka"},{"forms":["cut"],"lemma":"cut","pos":"adjective","en":"having a wound from something sharp","hu":"megvágott, sebes"},{"forms":["was taken to hospital"],"lemma":"be taken to hospital","pos":"phrase","en":"someone drove him to hospital","hu":"kórházba vitték"},{"forms":["pushed"],"lemma":"push","pos":"verb","en":"to move something away from you with your hands","hu":"tol, kitol"},{"forms":["seeing that"],"lemma":"seeing that","pos":"phrase","en":"when she noticed that","hu":"látva, hogy"},{"forms":["the back of"],"lemma":"the back of","pos":"phrase","en":"the part behind","hu":"valaminek a hátsó része"},{"forms":["called for"],"lemma":"call for","pos":"phrasal verb","en":"to phone and ask for something to come","hu":"hív, kihív (mentőt)"},{"forms":["fell down"],"lemma":"fall down","pos":"phrasal verb","en":"to fall to a lower place","hu":"leesik, legurul","tip":"Rendhagyó ige: fall – fell – fallen."},{"forms":["broke"],"lemma":"break","pos":"verb","en":"to damage a bone so that it crac