g wrong","hu":"vádol valamivel"},{"forms":["suffocated"],"lemma":"suffocate","pos":"verb","en":"to die because you cannot breathe","hu":"megfojt, megfullad"},{"forms":["drowned"],"lemma":"drown","pos":"verb","en":"to die, or kill someone, under water","hu":"vízbe fojt"},{"forms":["in more modern times"],"lemma":"in modern times","pos":"phrase","en":"in recent times; closer to our own time","hu":"az újabb időkben"},{"forms":["come to believe"],"lemma":"come to believe","pos":"phrase","en":"to slowly start to believe something","hu":"arra a meggyőződésre jut"},{"forms":["innocent"],"lemma":"innocent","pos":"adjective","en":"not guilty of a crime; also: not knowing about bad things","hu":"ártatlan"},{"forms":["instead"],"lemma":"instead","pos":"adverb","en":"in place of that; doing something different","hu":"ehelyett, inkább"},{"forms":["spirited his nephews abroad"],"lemma":"spirit someone away","pos":"phrase","en":"to take someone secretly to another country","hu":"titokban külföldre menekítette az unokaöccseit"},{"forms":["nephews"],"lemma":"nephew","pos":"noun","en":"the son of your brother or sister","hu":"unokaöcs"},{"forms":["nearer home"],"lemma":"nearer home","pos":"phrase","en":"in their own country, not far away","hu":"közelebb, az országon belül"},{"forms":["only for them to"],"lemma":"only for ... to","pos":"phrase","en":"used to say that something bad happened after that","hu":"csak azért, hogy aztán ..."},{"forms":["feared"],"lemma":"fear","pos":"verb","en":"to be afraid of something","hu":"fél valamitől, tart valamitől"},{"forms":["however"],"lemma":"however","pos":"adverb","en":"used to add something that is different from what was said before","hu":"azonban"},{"forms":["provided"],"lemma":"provide","pos":"verb","en":"to give something that is needed","hu":"nyújt, ad"},{"forms":["satisfactory"],"lemma":"satisfactory","pos":"adjective","en":"good enough","hu":"kielégítő"},{"forms":["mystery"],"lemma":"mystery","pos":"noun","en":"something strange that nobody can explain","hu":"rejtély"},{"forms":["simply"],"lemma":"simply","pos":"adverb","en":"just; only","hu":"egyszerűen"},{"forms":["chancellor"],"lemma":"chancellor","pos":"noun","en":"a very important official who worked for the king","hu":"kancellár, főkancellár"},{"forms":["buried","burial place"],"lemma":"bury","pos":"verb","en":"to put a dead body in the ground","hu":"eltemet (burial place = temetkezési hely, sír)"},{"forms":["at the foot of"],"lemma":"at the foot of","pos":"phrase","en":"at the bottom of","hu":"valaminek az alján, tövében"},{"forms":["long after"],"lemma":"long after","pos":"phrase","en":"a long time after","hu":"jóval azután"},{"forms":["passing"],"lemma":"passing","pos":"noun","en":"the end of something","hu":"elmúlás, vége"},{"forms":["dynasty"],"lemma":"dynasty","pos":"noun","en":"a family of rulers who rule a country for a long time","hu":"dinasztia, uralkodóház"},{"forms":["judged to be"],"lemma":"be judged to be","pos":"phrase","en":"people decided that they were","hu":"megítélésük szerint"},{"forms":["recovered"],"lemma":"recover","pos":"verb","en":"to find something and take it out","hu":"előkerül, megtalál"},{"forms":["resembled"],"lemma":"resemble","pos":"verb","en":"to look like something","hu":"hasonlít valamire"},{"forms":["description"],"lemma":"description","pos":"noun","en":"words that tell you what something is like","hu":"leírás"},{"forms":["interred"],"lemma":"inter","pos":"verb","en":"to put a dead body in a grave (formal)","hu":"eltemet, sírba helyez"},{"forms":["lies"],"lemma":"lie","pos":"verb","en":"if a dead person is in a place, their grave is there","hu":"nyugszik"},{"forms":["had every reason to"],"lemma":"have every reason to","pos":"phrase","en":"to have very good reasons to do something","hu":"minden oka megvolt rá, hogy"},{"forms":["deposed"],"lemma":"depose","pos":"verb","en":"to remove a ruler from power","hu":"letaszít, trónfoszt"},{"forms":["monarchs"],"lemma":"monarch","pos":"noun","en":"a king or a queen","hu":"uralkodó"},{"forms":["fate"],"lemma":"fate","pos":"noun","en":"what happens to someone in the end","hu":"sors"},{"forms":["depended entirely on"],"lemma":"depend on","pos":"phrasal verb","en":"to be decided only by","hu":"teljesen valamitől függött"},{"forms":["claim"],"lemma":"claim","pos":"noun","en":"a right to have something, e.g. the position of king","hu":"igény, jog valamire"},{"forms":["considered"],"lemma":"consider","pos":"verb","en":"to think of someone in a particular way","hu":"tekint valaminek"},{"forms":["deed"],"lemma":"deed","pos":"noun","en":"something that someone does, often bad (formal)","hu":"tett"},{"forms":["what were thought to be"],"lemma":"what were thought to be","pos":"phrase","en":"things that people believed were","hu":"amiket ...-nak véltek"},{"forms":["spot"],"lemma":"spot","pos":"noun","en":"a place","hu":"hely"},{"forms":["remained"],"lemma":"remain","pos":"verb","en":"to stay in the same state","hu":"maradt"}]$mtr$::jsonb, $mtr$[{"forms":["locked"],"lemma":"lock","pos":"verb","en":"to keep someone in a place by closing the door with a key","hu":"bezár"},{"forms":["suspicious circumstances"],"lemma":"suspicious circumstances","pos":"noun","en":"a situation that makes people think a crime may have happened","hu":"gyanús körülmények"},{"forms":["seized the throne"],"lemma":"seize the throne","pos":"phrase","en":"to take the position of king by force","hu":"magához ragadta a trónt"},{"forms":["spare"],"lemma":"spare","pos":"verb","en":"to not kill or hurt someone","hu":"megkímél, életben hagy"},{"forms":["murder","murdered"],"lemma":"murder","pos":"noun","en":"the crime of killing a person on purpose","hu":"gyilkosság; murdered = meggyilkolt"},{"forms":["suspected"],"lemma":"suspect","pos":"verb","en":"to think that something bad has probably happened","hu":"gyanít"},{"forms":["escaped"],"lemma":"escape","pos":"verb","en":"to get away from a place where you are kept","hu":"megszökik"},{"forms":["killed"],"lemma":"kill","pos"