ferent from what most people think","hu":"a közhiedelemmel ellentétben"},{"forms":["do listen"],"lemma":"do listen","pos":"phrase","en":"really listen (do makes the verb stronger)","hu":"igenis meghallgatnak"},{"forms":["a couple of"],"lemma":"a couple of","pos":"phrase","en":"two or a few","hu":"egy-két, néhány"},{"forms":["a certain amount of"],"lemma":"a certain amount of","pos":"phrase","en":"some; not a lot, but enough","hu":"bizonyos mennyiségű, némi"},{"forms":["faith"],"lemma":"faith","pos":"noun","en":"a strong belief that something will happen","hu":"hit, bizalom"},{"forms":["hiding"],"lemma":"hide","pos":"verb","en":"to be in a place where you cannot easily be seen","hu":"rejtőzik, megbújik"},{"forms":["hidden"],"lemma":"hidden","pos":"adjective","en":"not easy to see or find","hu":"rejtett"},{"forms":["re-explained"],"lemma":"re-explain","pos":"verb","en":"to explain something again","hu":"újra elmagyaráz"},{"forms":["replied"],"lemma":"reply","pos":"verb","en":"to answer","hu":"válaszol"},{"forms":["required"],"lemma":"require","pos":"verb","en":"to say that something must be done","hu":"megkövetel, előír"},{"forms":["one day’s notice"],"lemma":"notice","pos":"noun","en":"information given before something happens; one day's notice = telling them a day before","hu":"egy nappal előre történő bejelentés"},{"forms":["calendar day"],"lemma":"calendar day","pos":"noun","en":"a day from midnight to midnight","hu":"naptári nap"},{"forms":["enquired"],"lemma":"enquire","pos":"verb","en":"to ask for information","hu":"érdeklődik, megkérdez"},{"forms":["very first"],"lemma":"very first","pos":"phrase","en":"the first of all; the earliest","hu":"legeslegelső, legkorábbi"},{"forms":["midnight"],"lemma":"midnight","pos":"noun","en":"twelve o'clock at night","hu":"éjfél"},{"forms":["trip"],"lemma":"trip","pos":"noun","en":"a journey to a place","hu":"utazás, út"},{"forms":["exactly"],"lemma":"exactly","pos":"adverb","en":"not more or less","hu":"pontosan"},{"forms":[