ó képesség, rugalmasság"},{"forms":["spirited togetherness"],"lemma":"spirited togetherness","pos":"phrase","en":"brave and lively feeling of being a united group","hu":"lelkes összetartás"},{"forms":["would have seemed"],"lemma":"would have seemed","pos":"phrase","en":"used to say how something probably looked in the past","hu":"valószínűleg ... tűnt volna"},{"forms":["rather"],"lemma":"rather","pos":"adverb","en":"quite; fairly","hu":"meglehetősen, eléggé"},{"forms":["patronising"],"lemma":"patronising","pos":"adjective","en":"treating people as if they are less intelligent than you","hu":"leereszkedő, kioktató"},{"forms":["iconic"],"lemma":"iconic","pos":"adjective","en":"very famous and a symbol of something","hu":"ikonikus, jelképpé vált"},{"forms":["copies"],"lemma":"copy","pos":"noun","en":"one of many identical printed things","hu":"példány"},{"forms":["held back"],"lemma":"hold back","pos":"phrasal verb","en":"to not let something be used or seen","hu":"visszatart"},{"forms":["remained unseen"],"lemma":"remain unseen","pos":"phrase","en":"to stay hidden; nobody saw it","hu":"rejtve maradt"},{"forms":["survived"],"lemma":"survive","pos":"verb","en":"to continue to exist after a long time or danger","hu":"fennmaradt, megmaradt"},{"forms":["including"],"lemma":"including","pos":"preposition","en":"used to show what is part of a group","hu":"beleértve, köztük"},{"forms":["were taken by"],"lemma":"be taken by","pos":"phrase","en":"to like something very much as soon as you see it","hu":"elbűvölte őket, megtetszett nekik"},{"forms":["have it framed"],"lemma":"have something framed","pos":"phrase","en":"to pay someone to put a picture in a frame","hu":"bekereteztetik"},{"forms":["explosion"],"lemma":"explosion","pos":"noun","en":"a sudden very big increase","hu":"robbanás(szerű népszerűség)"},{"forms":["design items"],"lemma":"design item","pos":"noun","en":"an object that is well known for its good design","hu":"dizájntárgy"},{"forms":["reappeared"],"lemma":"reap